<title>USA: U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10.710 million bushels of U.S. soybeans inspected for export in the week ended Aug 22 were for the following destinations (1,000 bushels):</p>
<p>Chicago to Canada 928.</p>
<p>Duluth-Superior to Canada 141.</p>
<p>South Atlantic to Japan 2,116.</p>
<p>Mississippi River to Barbados 55; China 1,870; Taiwan 1,955; Colombia 129; Costa Rica 501; Japan 1,384; Portugal 161.</p>
<p>Interior to Mexico 1,012.</p>
</text>
